// `StaticSpec.SpecialAction` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). "Any time you have priority, within
// `when`, you may pay `cost` and do `does`" [CR#116.1,116.2c].
(
    name: "specialAction",
    kinds: [StaticSpec],
    params: {"when": Any, "cost": Cost, "does": Instruction},
    body: SpecialAction(when: Param(when), cost: Param(cost), does: Param(does)),
)
